      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Whenever a yamaraj would take electricity damage if not for its immunity, its fast healing increases to 40 on its next turn.\n\nDuring that turn, if it uses Beetle Breath, the beetles deal 2d12 additional electricity damage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
