      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "text": "The yamaraj breathes a blast of beetles in a 50-foot cone that deals 14d8 slashing damage and 4d8 persistent slashing damage to creatures in the area with a DC 42 Reflex save save.\n\nIt can't use Beetle Breath again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n---\n\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The creature takes half damage and is Sickened 1.\n\nFailure The creature takes full damage and is Sickened 2.\n\nCritical Failure The creature takes double damage and is Sickened 3."
    },
